# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}
    <p>{animal}</p>
{:else}
    {#if type === "dog"}
        no dogs
    {:else if type === "cat"}no cats{:else}no animals{/if}
{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -3,5 +3,9 @@
 {:else}
     {#if type === "dog"}
         no dogs
-    {:else if type === "cat"}no cats{:else}no animals{/if}
+    {:else if type === "cat"}
+        no cats
+    {:else}
+        no animals
+    {/if}
 {/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each animals as animal}
    <p>{animal}</p>
{:else}
    {#if type === "dog"}
        no dogs
    {:else if type === "cat"}
        no cats
    {:else}
        no animals
    {/if}
{/each}
```
